{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:03 2026-09-13 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:03 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:03 2026-09-13 HKT</p><p>油麻地驚現「飛天蠄蟧」入屋爆竊，卻失手就擒。今日（13日）下午1時45分，上海街122號一唐樓單位大門無故打開，街坊發現後報案。警員趕到調查，發現一名男子疑由一樓其中一個單位的鋁窗爬出，但他匆忙逃走，撞斷一枝樹枝跌下受傷，並遺留一隻拖鞋在帆布簷篷上。疑人當場被捕，稍後由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。</p><p>有目擊者稱，被捕男子膚色黝黑，疑似是南亞裔人士。現場消息稱，警方經初步調查，暫未發現有住客蒙受損失。</p><img alt=\"大批警員在場調查案件。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/918d6a397a9b2a631a8821d3f72ceca2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_31_01_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/63194e43518cf6a8c48ddb1dbc7634a6/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_31_01.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e035e03d77712a96fe21ce95e7ea9cc0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_31_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2211e0b30216b5f7f7b5715d4f9635aa/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_31_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"爆竊賊人撞斷樹枝跌下受傷，遺留一隻拖鞋在在帆布簷篷上。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6c37906105ba87d493dcc016ac2e5ea4/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_30_59_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/24de6655a37132612598556a9ca2cb81/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_30_59.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"樹枝被撞斷，帆布簷篷上遺留一隻拖鞋。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/35b5e590a8a68ac5686d2563701efe70/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_30_58_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d04befba189d3733e8cdaccf416bfc1a/2026-09/1_1_14.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a050bdb6935dbc916e881398e016bd4b/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_30_57_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"唐樓大廈驚現「飛天蠄蟧」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/84e4faa37e545ae6625a1616119704d2/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_30_57.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3e52c324930e00b8005c30cbe63d1d5d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-13_at_15_30_56.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T08:18:47.740907+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":281,"images":11,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}